## Persistence & wiring

- On Flow 1 success, persist `{ customerId, savedPaymentMethodToken }` against the buyer's
  profile. Use whatever store the repo already has; if none exists, a typed in-memory/JSON stub
  behind a clear interface is acceptable for now.
- On return, look up the buyer's PMT → mint the scoped token (`/api/vefi/token`) → render Flow
  2. Wire the reorder button to `/api/vefi/charge-token` (Path B) using the stored PMT.

